// Crafting Materials
demonic_ore_tooltip=Can be smelted into Demonic Bars.
void_fragment_tooltip=Can be combined into Void Shards, or used in other crafting recipes.
void_crystal_tooltip=These crystals glow with otherworldly power.
nightmare_ore_tooltip=Can be smelted into Nightmare Bars.\nThe material produces faint, unsettling whispers when held close to the ear.
nightmare_bar_tooltip=These bars feel freezing cold to the touch.

// Weapons
soul_eater_tooltip=On kill, grants a stack of Soul Power.\nUse [input=mouse2] to consume all stacks, gaining +10% melee damage per stack for 20 seconds.\nMaximum of ten stacks.
cursed_fire_tooltip=On hit, inflicts a 3 second stacking debuff that causes the target to take +5% damage per stack, up to a maximum of +25% damage taken.
nightmare_bow_tooltip=Projectiles inflict a stack of Ruin for five seconds.\nEach stack of Ruin causes the target to take +5% damage, up to a maximum of +25% damage at 5 stacks.

// Set bonuses
void_sentinel_melee_buff_tooltip=Reduces melee damage by 33%, but prevents resilience decay, and increases resilience gain by 100%.
void_sentinel_ranged_buff_tooltip=Reduces ranged attack speed by 50%, but increases ranged damage by 100%.
ancient_void_set_magic_buff_tooltip=Reduces mana usage by 50%, and increases magic attack speed by 100%,\nat the cost of -50% magic damage.
ancient_void_set_summoner_buff=Gain +3 summon slots, but decreases summon damage by 33%.

// Tools
nightmare_pickaxe_tooltip=Can mine Amber in the Deep Plains Caves.

// Consumables
corruption_potion_tooltip=+50% damage dealt, +50% damage received.

// Trinkets - Caves
ruinstone_tooltip=This stone pulses with otherworldly energy, and feels cold in your hands.\nCritical hits inflict one stack of Ruin for five seconds.\nEach stack of Ruin causes the target to take +5% damage, up to a maximum of +25% damage at 5 stacks.
corrupted_ring_tooltip=The ring feels painful to the touch.\nIncreases critical hit chance by +25%, but reduces critical damage by -50%.
void_pauldron=

// Trinkets - Deep Caves
amulet_of_corruption_tooltip=A powerful artifact of the Void Cult, used in channeling the power of the Void.\n+50% damage dealt, +50% damage received.
void_pauldron_tooltip=Converts your maximum health into resilience.\nPrevents health regeneration, but also prevents resilience decay, and grants significant resilience regeneration.\n+50% resilience gain.
void_vessel_tooltip=A fragile instrument for channeling the unstable energies of the Void.\nUpon landing a hit on a mob, grants a stack of Corruption.\nCorruption increases damage dealt by +10% per stack, at the cost of +10% damage taken per stack.\nMaximum of 10 stacks for targets.\nMaximum of 5 stacks for the user.
book_of_the_void_tooltip=A book containing eldritch knowledge of the Void itself.\nKilling an enemy with this trinket equipped causes them to explode in a burst of void energy.\nEnemies caught within this blast take damage, and suffer +20% damage taken for 10 seconds.

// Objects
visions_of_the_void_painting_tooltip="I have seen the Gates of Darkness, beyond which no waking eye may see.\nBehold, in darkness, a dreadful power sweeps the land."\n- Unknown
corruption_painting_tooltip="The power of the void is a siren's call.\nA wizard sought this power to protect his people.\nHe was a great hero, once upon a time.\nNow, he is nothing but a puppet, convinced that he is the master."\n- Unknown

// Miscellaneous
void_rift_tip=A tear in the fabric of reality itself, exposing this world to the Void.\nContact with this tile deals massive damage to anything in contact with it, unless it is otherwise immune.\nOnly available in creative mode.

